{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1e37108c3f8fdd75","type":"file","file":"仓库管理系统/日程实施计划/日记/系统基础模块/2026-07-22 Day7.md","x":-400,"y":-160,"width":560,"height":820,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"19bc38b4169effa0","type":"text","text":"# 为什么使用migration?而不是直接创建schema.sql?\n\t用以进行数据库的版本控制,配合git进行版本控制(追踪,升级,回滚等)\t","x":-270,"y":-480,"width":300,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"5d0bb585e85e1aac","type":"text","text":"# 数据库分层:\n\n认证与权限\n  users \n\n主数据\n  categories  \n  units \n  products\n  warehouses\n\n入库\n  stock_in_orders\n  stock_in_items\n\n出库\n  stock_out_orders\n  stock_out_items\n\n库存\n  stock_movements \n  stock_balance \n\n审计\n  audit_logs","x":280,"y":-50,"width":280,"height":600,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"72e8526830f6004f","type":"text","text":"# 数据库相关设计\n## 数据库删除设计 \n1. 已确认入库/出库单,库存流水,审计日志***不可删除***,仅能作废或冲销\n2. 主数据(users等)仅能停用而不是删除,使旧单据仍可追溯,历史数据保留\n## 字段设计\n1. 状态字段一般使用enum / varchar+check\n2. 单据系统常用结构:header+detail,即主表+明细表\n## migration回滚脚本顺序:\n\t一般与创建sql顺序相反:可能后创建的表对先创建的表存在依赖/外键\n\t例如:\n\t\t创建顺序为:users->product->stock_in_orders->stock_in_items\n\t\t那么回滚顺序为stock_in_items->stock_in_orders->product->users\n\t","x":694,"y":-160,"width":386,"height":710,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"671ec33d5160c32c","x":60,"y":700,"width":1320,"height":980,"type":"text","text":"# 数据库ER图\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    users ||--o{ audit_logs : \"记录操作日志\"\n    categories ||--o{ products : \"包含产品\"\n    units ||--o{ products : \"使用单位\"\n    warehouses ||--o{ stock_movements : \"发生库存变动\"\n    warehouses ||--o{ stock_balance : \"持有库存余额\"\n    products ||--o{ inbound_details : \"入库明细\"\n    products ||--o{ outbound_details : \"出库明细\"\n    products ||--o{ stock_movements : \"库存变动\"\n    products ||--o{ stock_balance : \"库存余额\"\n    inbound_orders ||--o{ inbound_details : \"包含明细\"\n    outbound_orders ||--o{ outbound_details : \"包含明细\"\n    stock_movements }o--|| inbound_details : \"来源入库明细\"\n    stock_movements }o--|| outbound_details : \"来源出库明细\"\n\n    users {\n        int id PK\n        varchar username\n    }\n    categories {\n        int id PK\n        varchar name\n    }\n    units {\n        int id PK\n        varchar name\n    }\n    warehouses {\n        int id PK\n        varchar name\n    }\n    products {\n        int id PK\n        varchar name\n        int category_id FK\n        int unit_id FK\n    }\n    inbound_orders {\n        int id PK\n        varchar order_no\n    }\n    outbound_orders {\n        int id PK\n        varchar order_no\n    }\n    inbound_details {\n        int id PK\n        int order_id FK\n        int product_id FK\n        int quantity\n    }\n    outbound_details {\n        int id PK\n        int order_id FK\n        int product_id FK\n        int quantity\n    }\n    stock_movements {\n        int id PK\n        int warehouse_id FK\n        int product_id FK\n        varchar source_type\n        int source_id\n        int source_line_id\n        int quantity\n    }\n    stock_balance {\n        int id PK\n        int warehouse_id FK\n        int product_id FK\n        int quantity\n    }\n    audit_logs {\n        int id PK\n        int user_id FK\n        text action\n    }\n```"}
	],
